Local CUDA fusion patch: RMSNorm + RoPE and INT8 GEMM + dequant epilogue.
Always enabled for eligible shapes; fallback paths and memory ownership are retained.
The INT8 CUDA source is vendored in third_party/fused_int8, not a kitchen dependency.

